-- $D$: 2D grid of depth values, shape $(H, W)$.
-- $\mathbf{I}$: 2D grid of image intensities (or per-channel RGB), shape $(H, W, C)$.
-- $\mathbf{u}$: Pixel coordinate $(x, y)$.
