+- $\mathbf{u}$: Pixel coordinate $(x, y)$ [S1].
 
 **Outputs:**
-- $\mathcal{L}_{\text{reg. depth}}$: Scalar loss value.
+- $\mathcal{L}_{\text{reg. depth}}[\mathbf{u}]$: Per-pixel regularization loss value [S1].
 
